<title>UK: UK's Premier Oil raises stake in N.Sea block.</title>
<headline>UK's Premier Oil raises stake in N.Sea block.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Premier Oil Plc said on Thursday it had bought a further 15 percent interest in North Sea Block 29/2c from Mobil Corp, raising its stake in the block to 35 percent.  </p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Following the disposal, the remaining partners in the block plan to complete appraisal of the Kyle Field, with a further well in 1997 followed by an extended well test, leading to early development of the field, Premier said in a statement. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
